OL,3,AUK diesel price hits all-time high, the
OL,4,ARAC says
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe RAC said diesel prices had entered
OL,7,F"uncharted territory" and served as a
OL,8,Freminder of "just how exposed the UK is
OL,9,Fto events occurring far away".
